VALUES ('Voyager 1', 'Voyager 1 was built by the Jet Propulsion Laboratory (JPL). It has a bus shaped like a decagonal (ten-sided) prism. It has 16 hydrazine thrusters, three-axis stabilization gyroscopes, and referencing instruments to keep the probe''s radio antenna pointed toward Earth. Collectively, these instruments are part of the Attitude and Articulation Control Subsystem (AACS), along with redundant ', TO_VECTOR(TO_CLOB('[-0.08324011, -0.05847861, -0.00776325, 0.01043678, -0.07417881, -0.03134906, -0.02218741, 0.07582139, 0.00542422, 0.01484456, 0.00221396, 0.03462387, 0.04731243, -0.01852638, -0.03322115, -0.01780336, 0.03053473, -0.07837442, 0.00116228, -0.04878157, 0.00643895, 0.05687745, 0.11164676, -0.00758188, -0.00223099, -0.00781193, 0.01340957, -0.05004541, 0.03882597, -0.10099782, 0.01632105, 0.03357235, 0.00727263, 0.01402373, -0.03145605, -0.03698111, 0.09065896, -0.01937539, 0.04399246, 0.02303895, -0.01808452, -0.00885536, -0.02551916, -0.01660185, -0.03855231, -0.00009164, 0.00624456, -0.04951621, 0.09058186, 0.02066254, 0.02575357, -0.02502877, -0.01526065, 0.01623102, 0.01382056, 0.01835696, -0.06267495, 0.10554779, -0.00440137, -0.00951235, -0.01000821, -0.03742908, -0.04285762, -0.00270308, -0.04283380, -0.03023792, -0.01027821, -0.01220282, 0.10616384, -0.03190733, -0.02454705, -0.05390821, 0.02831247, 0.01412021, 0.00369014, 0.02682492, 0.04572299, 0.04486967, 0.07691526, -0.06627024, -0.05211832, 0.01253147, -0.06022164, 0.05271541, -0.00567316, 0.03862571, -0.02204558, -0.01437397, 0.06652160, -0.01167319, 0.01894021, -0.07531392, -0.00587656, -0.05356022, -0.02972333, 0.02075446, -0.03977014, -0.00087305, 0.01199786, -0.01248276, 0.03119676, 0.03575813, 0.06509896, 0.15031661, -0.08898766, 0.01521709, 0.00229168, -0.01636579, 0.04122258, -0.06188652, -0.07228252, 0.01273385, -0.04777344, -0.03039509, -0.06807617, -0.08368748, -0.03454231, 0.05138293, -0.03155814, -0.08710239, -0.01860101, -0.08833593, 0.02589576, -0.02602450, -0.0387