VALUES ('Voyager 1', 'Voyager 1 has three radioisotope thermoelectric generators (RTGs) mounted on a boom. Each MHW-RTG contains 24 pressed plutonium-238 PuO2 oxide spheres. The RTGs generated about 470 W of electric power at the time of launch, with the remainder being dissipated as waste heat. The power output of the RTGs declines over time due to the 87.7-year half-life of the fuel and degradation of the t', TO_VECTOR(TO_CLOB('[-0.04897529, 0.04483226, -0.01068281, 0.08374123, -0.00079715, -0.00579973, -0.00782706, 0.06795385, -0.06899872, 0.04169410, -0.00716776, -0.02058099, 0.04239408, -0.03843426, -0.00290120, 0.01028960, -0.02242702, -0.12196191, 0.04294129, -0.03783412, 0.06452193, 0.04903353, 0.04728116, 0.01795291, 0.04726098, -0.04588400, 0.00697683, -0.00703393, 0.02403026, 0.00536024, -0.08890550, 0.04849195, 0.00741013, -0.00554574, 0.00464348, 0.09417375, 0.03286738, 0.00826285, 0.01967882, 0.03484032, -0.04555686, -0.05726874, 0.01752497, 0.06264136, -0.09858704, -0.01846415, 0.02324411, 0.01284460, 0.04771968, -0.03630113, 0.07865698, 0.01025903, 0.02170266, 0.05034994, -0.02679688, 0.00443672, 0.01186837, 0.07630155, 0.01472809, -0.02008819, -0.02816929, -0.04095363, -0.03405461, -0.01746589, 0.04325474, -0.05976222, 0.02294720, 0.03680686, 0.01160914, 0.03572269, -0.05583397, -0.05311714, -0.04726357, -0.02972245, -0.00187829, 0.08961162, 0.04906140, -0.02250262, 0.03529037, -0.05047695, -0.01793113, -0.07023712, -0.04850207, -0.03232855, 0.00722568, 0.02105811, 0.06602515, -0.03722040, 0.04871726, 0.03926526, -0.04735529, 0.02402806, 0.03590018, -0.03361220, -0.01910193, 0.05490199, -0.05102971, -0.00998199, 0.04842138, -0.09195425, -0.02032593, 0.03147711, -0.03055906, 0.00968670, -0.00462447, 0.02428962, -0.08101244, -0.01636277, 0.08477528, -0.03184988, -0.01664150, 0.01858157, -0.02807143, 0.00773727, 0.01060470, -0.02824567, -0.09445443, 0.01607368, 0.00206781, 0.02652954, -0.04131301, -0.00459720, 0.03215534, 0.04012006, -0.11308262, -0.04