VALUES ('Voyager 1', 'The Voyager 1 probe was launched on September 5, 1977, from Launch Complex 41 at the Cape Canaveral Air Force Station, aboard a Titan IIIE launch vehicle. The Voyager 2 probe had been launched two weeks earlier, on August 20, 1977. Despite being launched later, Voyager 1 reached both Jupiter and Saturn sooner, following a shorter trajectory.', TO_VECTOR(TO_CLOB('[-0.01239983, -0.02739790, 0.07298652, 0.05084567, 0.02171067, -0.01693999, -0.05207508, 0.02885083, -0.06632745, 0.06148609, -0.01951218, 0.01797891, -0.01048062, 0.00205539, 0.03031601, -0.01365048, 0.01132700, -0.12714654, 0.06449683, -0.04680995, 0.02042449, 0.02207546, 0.04024827, -0.00620167, 0.03390843, -0.06462041, -0.03006392, -0.09681541, 0.04921266, 0.00858055, -0.03974438, -0.01702812, -0.05194522, -0.00123727, -0.04242531, -0.03573029, 0.05658015, 0.00931893, 0.05564722, -0.00072269, -0.01642100, -0.01185031, -0.02809784, 0.00689171, -0.02188588, -0.00185966, 0.07096865, 0.00152346, 0.12757762, -0.02170923, 0.00446017, 0.04868598, 0.04056049, -0.07013760, -0.04957575, 0.04584558, -0.06624191, 0.03365867, 0.03026741, -0.05303960, -0.08147494, -0.07667163, 0.00944999, -0.06491239, -0.05056330, 0.02347512, 0.00101314, -0.04433922, 0.08317674, 0.02410757, -0.02109352, 0.00064234, -0.00089264, -0.01785180, 0.05240097, 0.08477723, 0.06762700, 0.05549751, 0.00485455, -0.09723128, -0.03847132, -0.05820078, -0.01327446, 0.06247538, -0.03725495, 0.07672942, -0.02474809, -0.00850769, 0.02190904, -0.06174312, 0.02163563, -0.04097847, -0.00113089, 0.01105207, -0.05123929, -0.04669809, -0.00330061, 0.05697697, 0.10446498, -0.02416701, 0.00685972, 0.03045833, 0.01652730, 0.04155664, 0.00412962, 0.06522963, 0.00483638, -0.08127493, 0.05663323, -0.05326509, 0.00427686, 0.00848081, 0.06353300, 0.00124546, -0.04914930, -0.01192874, -0.00742619, 0.05286765, -0.00125882, -0.02666234, -0.00604344, -0.06751657, 0.04874805, -0.01833411, -0.13739738, -0.03407978, 0.12237050, 0.00000000, -0.02623529