VALUES ('Voyager 1', 'At cutoff, the Centaur was only 3.4 seconds from propellant exhaustion. If the same failure had occurred during Voyager 2''s launch a few weeks earlier, the Centaur would have run out of propellant before the probe reached the correct trajectory. Jupiter was in a more favorable position vis-à-vis Earth during the launch of Voyager 1 than during the launch of Voyager 2.', TO_VECTOR(TO_CLOB('[0.01699908, -0.02044630, 0.12078194, -0.00485647, 0.08886881, -0.04816735, -0.07138977, 0.07278833, -0.03557410, 0.02575195, -0.08228067, -0.03189743, 0.00075872, -0.01764831, 0.03857367, -0.03020905, 0.09633338, -0.06955667, 0.00361061, 0.01428064, 0.03435105, 0.08454098, 0.01821635, 0.09660020, 0.02417203, -0.05431021, 0.01955972, -0.04263384, 0.01890280, -0.03294639, -0.05067539, -0.00896475, -0.04204806, -0.03489270, -0.09250039, -0.03148690, 0.06213288, 0.01775687, 0.04635457, -0.01197071, -0.05056031, -0.02637544, -0.06193037, -0.00681184, 0.01568139, 0.01604866, -0.01515246, -0.03022276, 0.07738528, 0.01829465, -0.00906908, 0.05747914, -0.02630883, -0.05714194, -0.04478436, 0.01102076, -0.02561334, 0.04862380, 0.04343691, -0.04200933, -0.02840875, -0.05125832, 0.01031776, 0.01136546, 0.01462471, -0.06873867, -0.07208376, -0.03805004, 0.05252810, 0.06171098, 0.02321289, 0.00719042, -0.01052963, -0.09906797, 0.02276601, 0.03868880, 0.05837553, 0.04558831, 0.02141362, -0.03979906, -0.00678423, 0.00068567, 0.02963172, -0.03836156, -0.02120627, -0.01189625, 0.02691671, -0.04027253, -0.09028742, -0.08317265, 0.04705824, -0.03073222, 0.01588316, 0.00146728, 0.01174920, -0.00745982, -0.06352556, -0.04680828, 0.06245822, -0.01469347, 0.02847803, 0.08556044, -0.06765234, -0.04258759, 0.02410209, 0.08482384, -0.00748634, -0.03770369, -0.00961879, 0.02124920, 0.05284502, -0.00401347, 0.05864042, 0.00178643, -0.02214204, 0.02345308, -0.12123712, 0.03441638, 0.01156816, -0.05532478, -0.02061944, -0.07130188, -0.00572280, -0.05147515, -0.07170715, -0.00902412, 0.089