VALUES ('Voyager 1', 'Because observations of Titan were considered vital, the trajectory chosen for Voyager 1 was designed around the optimum Titan flyby, which took it below the south pole of Saturn and out of the plane of the ecliptic, ending its planetary science mission. Had Voyager 1 failed or been unable to observe Titan, Voyager 2''s trajectory would have been altered to incorporate the Titan flyby, p', TO_VECTOR(TO_CLOB('[-0.03955898, -0.01150043, 0.07853750, 0.01407355, 0.09294180, -0.00994487, 0.00152816, 0.07859947, -0.01228073, 0.07295357, -0.02784200, 0.02355011, -0.00618320, -0.07038064, -0.00282414, -0.04989690, -0.00202922, -0.10905743, 0.06826484, -0.02850221, -0.00022939, 0.05410273, 0.02973627, 0.01128650, -0.01444067, -0.00642176, -0.04015504, -0.04349390, 0.05086790, -0.03294646, 0.02439740, 0.05835569, -0.06916942, -0.00151464, -0.07062896, -0.04734279, 0.10766164, -0.03780516, -0.00806855, -0.02164434, 0.02692723, 0.07845411, -0.05454883, -0.05551287, 0.02635715, -0.03635957, 0.07851344, -0.03109194, 0.07148897, -0.01914087, 0.04899361, -0.01550897, 0.01439748, -0.03370824, -0.00188626, 0.07928903, -0.06739342, 0.01812743, 0.02391260, -0.07883327, -0.05399428, -0.02649332, 0.05656016, -0.02798590, 0.04144908, -0.03645594, -0.02095150, -0.09267011, 0.06696237, 0.06064891, -0.01428286, -0.00894627, -0.02520443, 0.00384694, -0.02181895, 0.01920580, 0.08460002, 0.05374855, 0.00169347, -0.07337944, -0.00568927, -0.00402404, -0.04297560, 0.07711766, -0.00666033, 0.09716345, -0.05209655, -0.08938092, 0.05085953, -0.03499788, 0.14034870, -0.05970995, 0.04803129, -0.03450070, -0.04225731, -0.02249957, -0.00509743, -0.02150887, 0.03429985, 0.01139894, -0.01503992, 0.02345381, -0.01039208, 0.06252179, -0.00944378, 0.05180012, 0.05373463, -0.10597408, 0.03247200, 0.06200209, 0.01840731, -0.00845119, 0.06171236, 0.00142126, -0.03829670, -0.00812550, -0.05618025, 0.05833214, -0.02790729, -0.01828154, -0.09255534, -0.03747296, -0.02659782, 0.03068839, -0.07