VALUES ('Voyager 1', 'On February 14, 1990, Voyager 1 took the first "family portrait" of the Solar System as seen from outside, which includes the image of planet Earth known as Pale Blue Dot. Soon afterward, its cameras were deactivated to conserve energy and computer resources for other equipment. The camera software has been removed from the spacecraft, so it would now be complex to get them working again', TO_VECTOR(TO_CLOB('[-0.09931701, 0.02118068, 0.11012828, -0.04158994, 0.11755995, -0.04321157, 0.01809435, 0.04023808, 0.00039571, -0.00482442, 0.04130195, 0.01126867, 0.00471902, -0.00579332, 0.02369935, -0.06288854, -0.00327101, -0.12477276, 0.02020479, 0.00999868, -0.05719502, 0.01321224, -0.03973910, 0.03648561, 0.01680414, 0.04234705, 0.01360595, -0.03952042, -0.00893009, -0.01441515, -0.06125505, 0.01460703, 0.03182472, -0.00754431, -0.01436533, -0.03513755, 0.06960379, -0.00684530, -0.04019897, -0.02083070, -0.04759261, -0.01307960, 0.00395180, -0.06683015, 0.01387485, 0.01801803, 0.05547149, -0.03945075, 0.04573108, -0.00819617, -0.00885070, -0.01050206, 0.04965985, 0.01944916, 0.00243210, 0.04019775, -0.02635643, 0.04101793, 0.03109844, 0.00157489, -0.04179583, -0.01445214, -0.03507306, 0.04052334, 0.03313861, 0.07358954, -0.01885380, -0.11820932, 0.03729093, -0.04485736, -0.06888501, 0.03068512, -0.04272597, -0.01895486, 0.02558350, 0.08924820, 0.06976830, 0.03466122, 0.02983307, -0.12275732, 0.05482825, -0.00086311, -0.06370918, 0.08955662, -0.02385821, 0.05863879, -0.09823647, -0.00095269, 0.00587453, -0.08069788, -0.04986464, -0.04792389, 0.02131398, -0.07143331, -0.02928001, -0.04735667, 0.01564485, -0.00956115, 0.06703055, 0.02888402, 0.03895424, -0.02879526, 0.01334305, 0.02837081, 0.04011284, 0.01643471, 0.04140626, 0.00296827, 0.08124631, -0.03868508, 0.00365438, -0.00134113, -0.03677468, -0.02108271, -0.04478467, -0.06979938, -0.04147753, 0.04958409, -0.05356199, -0.08316028, 0.05984708, -0.08673440, -0.04095094, -0.01993784, -0.03041278, -