VALUES ('Voyager 1', 'On February 17, 1998, Voyager 1 reached a distance of 69 AU (6.4 billion mi; 10.3 billion km) from the Sun and overtook Pioneer 10 as the most distant spacecraft from Earth. Traveling at about 17 km/s (11 mi/s), it has the fastest heliocentric recession speed of any spacecraft.', TO_VECTOR(TO_CLOB('[0.05884488, -0.02264873, -0.00043615, -0.02424619, -0.01173344, -0.00319490, -0.04966607, 0.07041874, -0.06954628, 0.00549894, 0.02904408, -0.00606437, -0.02281297, -0.01380784, 0.02827451, -0.03548869, 0.08541578, -0.09138113, -0.06083569, -0.02083425, -0.06003598, 0.00310925, 0.03663638, 0.04599388, 0.07074652, -0.02487439, 0.00200277, -0.11424217, -0.01539375, 0.00393488, -0.02396557, -0.02793465, 0.00684727, -0.05063147, -0.02573538, 0.01497782, 0.03892799, -0.00781244, 0.07454912, -0.03388366, 0.00889661, -0.03984215, 0.01422968, 0.03870698, -0.00102188, -0.03429590, -0.02655184, 0.01756520, 0.05250651, 0.01727869, -0.07790618, 0.04518269, -0.01710434, -0.02837333, -0.00686288, 0.03020883, -0.03319591, 0.00001956, 0.03970186, -0.01397911, 0.01016428, -0.09202017, 0.02499083, -0.04798077, -0.04456190, 0.00134391, -0.04504243, -0.04036814, -0.00482998, 0.09828614, -0.01206586, 0.03980437, -0.03651815, 0.00369893, 0.06468461, 0.00562376, 0.08050290, 0.07725984, 0.06679191, -0.12078782, 0.04367058, -0.00027297, -0.05639990, 0.04753885, -0.02884298, -0.01379053, 0.03502139, 0.08598638, 0.01259100, -0.01476008, 0.07111125, -0.08173542, -0.02862745, -0.09214085, -0.07585787, -0.04842845, -0.07084183, 0.03114893, 0.02684462, -0.02817305, 0.08461971, 0.08717082, -0.07762644, 0.08147155, 0.02105812, 0.09502940, 0.02235625, 0.00514525, 0.02541389, 0.03309596, 0.04706954, -0.00127855, -0.08826628, -0.06063861, -0.07904311, -0.05394711, 0.00270071, 0.10443749, 0.03202255, 0.01211594, -0.07282914, 0.02748938, 0.04771234, 0.04819222, -0.00794998, -0.07215530, 0.10649692, 0.00000000, -0.03903407, 0.01962235, -0.02718625, -0.02018398, -0.08746070, 0.04204511, -