VALUES ('Voyager 1', 'As Voyager 1 headed for interstellar space, its instruments continued to study the Solar System. Jet Propulsion Laboratory scientists used the plasma wave experiments aboard Voyager 1 and 2 to look for the heliopause, the boundary at which the solar wind transitions into the interstellar medium. As of 2013, the probe was moving with a relative velocity to the Sun of about 61,197 kilomete', TO_VECTOR(TO_CLOB('[-0.06198455, 0.02170182, 0.01947501, 0.02412398, -0.01630376, -0.03969802, -0.04695872, -0.00363736, -0.06494554, -0.05177924, 0.00149303, -0.04183678, -0.04644409, -0.05690728, 0.00948336, -0.01425929, 0.03135309, -0.08005995, 0.04938395, -0.05305365, -0.05625905, 0.00765138, 0.02758670, -0.04298458, 0.11548209, 0.02125258, -0.04152136, -0.07421254, -0.01198446, 0.04899144, 0.02127834, 0.03777671, -0.12872796, 0.03341783, 0.02718299, -0.00853286, 0.08518666, -0.00780794, 0.05493258, 0.01556775, -0.00131711, -0.04802471, -0.05018914, 0.03753696, -0.01690951, -0.03977195, -0.01873433, 0.00506078, 0.07463297, 0.03184205, -0.03022572, -0.00063376, 0.04457389, 0.02615485, 0.00867094, 0.04223432, 0.02827361, 0.02726814, 0.03922034, -0.06860527, -0.02208491, -0.06965011, -0.05033971, 0.01581890, -0.03223899, -0.05866976, 0.01470343, 0.02453001, 0.01917186, -0.03128410, -0.03521514, 0.06763122, -0.02739433, 0.01139494, 0.08014113, 0.00486815, 0.02081914, 0.03244459, 0.07575502, -0.07497853, -0.00657872, 0.02092259, -0.09235376, 0.09488811, -0.06484422, 0.08235872, -0.01769505, -0.00280701, 0.01058793, 0.03019389, 0.00202546, -0.10319176, -0.08130480, -0.04951526, -0.00412915, 0.02822863, -0.01739318, -0.01364821, 0.12579682, -0.04125576, 0.02220207, 0.00004521, -0.02292466, 0.11512960, -0.08914990, 0.07244879, 0.03900196, 0.00054528, 0.05089309, 0.06217766, -0.01397928, 0.00337897, -0.02537629, -0.07614963, 0.04672833, 0.00609865, -0.03139047, 0.07699509, -0.06840097, -0.01785038, -0.04259148, -0.02176022, 0.00379342, 0.06153345, -0.01182781, -0.